tly optimizes the segmentation strategy while learning to model the sequence【S1】.  \nBecause the routing decisions are differentiable (via straight‑through estimators) the network can adjust where to cut the stream during training, compressing the input into semantically meaningful pieces without any external tokenizers【S1】.  ", "reasoning_chars": 212}}
